d construction step exposes the persisted format\u0027s meaning and avoids reader guesswork.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"java":{"insertions":49,"deletions":25}}},{"hash":"972ac3e08d2fe5f70b5e0ee3b7bf22a1002cd8fb","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Decompose saved task parsing","messageBody":"Saved-record parsing currently mixes common validation, subtype construction, date-error translation, and completion restoration. Extract cohesive helpers so parseTask presents the successful reconstruction flow at a single level of abstraction and each validation stage is easier to inspect.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"java":{"insertions":59,"deletions":28}}},{"hash":"9ec13830a846bf0b9e1f433e3599a32e2bfb6423","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Remove duplicate repository declaration","messageBody":"The build declares Maven Central twice in consecutive repository blocks, which suggests a distinction that does not exist. Keep one declaration so the dependency configuration remains concise and easier to scan without changing resolution behavior.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"gradle":{"insertions":0,"deletions":4}}},{"hash":"b4f64e1e8c2f6732145f62258a61ce93e31656c2","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Extract command argument parsing","messageBody":"Parser methods repeatedly expose the substring operation used to remove command keywords. Centralize that low-level detail in a named helper so each parser method stays focused on validating and converting its own arguments, while keeping prefix handling consistent.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"java":{"insertions":13,"deletions":6}}},{"hash":"2a0004639021b7c7ac76ae1335d3f203d880b993","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Refactor collection operations to use Java streams","messageBody":"Replace imperative for-loops with declarative Java Stream pipelines in TaskList for filtering, searching, and formatting outputs. Improves conciseness and expresses functional transformations cleanly.\n","fileTypesAndContr